# Anchorage Digital Asset Assessment Engagement

## Overview

This folder documents confidential asset assessment work performed for **Anchorage Digital**.

Due to confidentiality obligations, the full deliverables are not published. This folder is intended to contain a summary of the engagement while keeping sensitive operational and assessment details private.

## About Anchorage Digital

**Anchorage Digital** is an institutional digital asset platform offering custody, trading, staking, governance, and related infrastructure for institutional clients.

Anchorage Digital publicly presents itself as the **only federally chartered crypto bank** and positions its custody platform around institutional-grade security and regulatory infrastructure.

## Why This Engagement Matters

Anchorage Digital is one of the strongest names in institutional digital asset custody and banking infrastructure. Security and risk work performed for Anchorage Digital is therefore a strong reference for work in highly regulated and security-sensitive digital asset environments.

This is especially relevant for:
- digital asset risk and asset assessment work
- institutional custody environments
- compliance-sensitive digital asset infrastructure
- banking-grade crypto operations

## Engagement Scope

**Softstack has served as Anchorage Digital’s exclusive asset assessment provider since 2021.**

**This work has included assessments related to USDT, USDC, PYUSD, DAI and hundreds of other across Ripple, Stellar, Polygon, Solana, Avalanche, Cardano, Sui, Aptos etc.**

**The engagement has included custody security assessments intended to support asset integrity and regulatory compliance.**

**This work has also involved close collaboration with asset issuers, including example issuers such as Tether and Circle.**


## Summary

This folder highlights Softstack’s confidential work for **Anchorage Digital**.

It is a strong reference for Softstack’s involvement in **institutional digital asset assessment**, **custody-related risk review**, and **security work for highly regulated crypto infrastructure**.
